        "logo": "shopify://shop_images/GMCo_Webclip.png",
        "logo_width": 200,
        "description": "<p>The GOOD Mask Co. was born out of an extraordinary moment in world history: the global pandemic of March 2020.</p><p>One of the company’s co-founders, Anders Hsi was approached by his father, a qualified professional healthcare consultant operating out of New Mexico, USA. His Dad’s long-term friend was the Director of the New Mexico Children, Youth & Family Department who were urgently requesting help in sourcing high-quality PPE equipment in the face of rising COVID cases sweeping the state.</p>",
        "section_padding_top": 60,
        "section_padding_bottom": 60,
        "background_color": "#ffffff"
      }
    },
