            "text_BChqxf": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Anders, from his time living and working in China, was able to source the right manufacturer and procure face masks of a superior quality.</p><p>He opted to create a business model whereby a proportion  of the sales would be donated in respirator stock to help out the  New Mexico Children, Youth & Family Department, not forgetting  his Dad too.</p><p>Hence the name. The GOOD Mask Co. was created to do good right off the bat, albeit in highly dramatic circumstances.</p><p>Face masks made to keep those you love safe. Face masks made to protect the wider environment. Face masks made to allow the world to function and breathe a little easier. Affordable, great quality, extremely comfortable and highly effective.</p><p>The GOOD Mask Co. Made to spread the good.</p>",
