            "text_ayHTAk": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Every face. Every breath. Every particle.  We’ve got you covered.</p><p>Every loved one. Every moment. Every day. We’re here to comfort and protect you.</p><p>Born to do good, to be good, to give back good. A never-ending virtuous circle.</p><p>We’re face mask makers and we’re people too.  Just as vulnerable. Just as human as you are.</p><p>We want what you want. To be closer to those we cherish.</p><p>Here’s to good health and good lives. Let’s spread the GOOD.</p>",
